{
  "schema": "app-studio/canvas@1",
  "id": "example-geo-formlikhet",
  "name": "formlikhet.html",
  "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!--\n  Formlikhet og kongruens — Halison App Studio-eksempel\n\n  Interaktivt læremiddel for geometri (matematikk 1P/2P, LK20): formlike og\n  kongruente figurer, skaleringsfaktor, og hvordan areal og volum skalerer.\n\n  Fra Halison App Studio sitt offentlige bibliotek:\n  https://github.com/halisonworks/public-app-studio\n\n  Tillatt bruk: personlig, pedagogisk og annen ikke-kommersiell bruk. Behold denne\n  headeren og kildelenken; ikke-kommersiell bruk. Utgitt under Halison App Studio\n  Examples License — se LICENSE-filen i repoet over.\n-->\n<html lang=\"no\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Formlikhet og kongruens – Matematikk 1P/2P</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; }\n    .tab-btn { transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s; }\n    .tab-btn.active { background: #1d4ed8; color: #fff; }\n    .tab-btn:not(.active) { background: #e0e7ff; color: #1d4ed8; }\n    .step-box { border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; background: #eff6ff; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 8px 0; }\n    .formula-box { background: #fef9c3; border: 1px solid #fbbf24; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 1.05em; }\n    .highlight { color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: bold; }\n    .warn-box { background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 14px; }\n    input[type=range] { accent-color: #3b82f6; }\n    input[type=number] { border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; width: 80px; font-size: 1em; }\n    select { border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 1em; }\n    .svg-container { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; }\n    .kongruent-badge { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; border: 1.5px solid #6ee7b7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 12px; font-size: 0.92em; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }\n    .formlik-badge { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e3a8a; border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 12px; font-size: 0.92em; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-blue-50 min-h-screen\">\n\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-3 py-6\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-5 mb-5\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n      <span class=\"text-3xl\">📐</span>\n      <div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800\">Formlikhet og kongruens</h1>\n        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Matematikk 1P/2P · LK20 · Geometri</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-gray-700 mt-2 text-sm\">\n      Utforsk formlike og kongruente figurer interaktivt. Juster skaleringsfaktoren, finn manglende sider, og se hvordan areal og volum skalerer.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Tabs -->\n  <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap\">\n    <button class=\"tab-btn active rounded-lg px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-sm\" onclick=\"showTab('teori')\">Teori</button>\n    <button class=\"tab-btn rounded-lg px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-sm\" onclick=\"showTab('trekant')\">Trekanter</button>\n    <button class=\"tab-btn rounded-lg px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-sm\" onclick=\"showTab('rektangel')\">Rektangler</button>\n    <button class=\"tab-btn rounded-lg px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-sm\" onclick=\"showTab('areal')\">Areal &amp; volum</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── TAB: TEORI ── -->\n  <div id=\"tab-teori\" class=\"tab-content\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-5 mb-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-3\">Hva er kongruente figurer?</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n        To figurer er <strong>kongruente</strong> dersom de har nøyaktig samme form <em>og</em> størrelse.\n        Den ene kan roteres, speiles eller forskyves slik at den passer perfekt oppå den andre.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"formula-box mb-3\">\n        Kongruente figurer: <span class=\"highlight\">alle tilsvarende sider like lange</span> og <span class=\"highlight\">alle tilsvarende vinkler like store</span>.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex gap-4 justify-center my-4\">\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 100\" aria-label=\"Kongruente trekanter\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,90 55,10 100,90\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"55\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e40af\">△ABC</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center text-2xl text-green-600 font-bold\">≅</div>\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 100\" aria-label=\"Kongruente trekanter\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,90 55,10 100,90\" fill=\"#d1fae5\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"55\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#065f46\">△DEF</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"kongruent-badge\">△ABC ≅ △DEF</span>\n\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mt-6 mb-3\">Hva er formlike figurer?</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n        To figurer er <strong>formlike</strong> dersom de har samme form, men kan ha ulik størrelse.\n        Tilsvarende vinkler er like, og tilsvarende sider er <em>proporsjonale</em> – de har samme <strong>formlikhetsforhold</strong> (skaleringsfaktor <em>k</em>).\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"formula-box mb-3\">\n        <div>Formlikhetsforhold: <span class=\"highlight\">k = a' / a = b' / b = c' / c</span></div>\n        <div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">der a, b, c er sider i den lille figuren og a', b', c' er tilsvarende sider i den store.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex gap-4 justify-center items-end my-4\">\n        <svg width=\"90\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 90 80\" aria-label=\"Liten trekant\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,70 45,10 80,70\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"45\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e40af\">Liten</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-blue-700 font-bold\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg\">×k</span>\n          <span class=\"text-2xl\">→</span>\n        </div>\n        <svg width=\"140\" height=\"126\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 126\" aria-label=\"Stor trekant\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,116 70,10 130,116\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"70\" y=\"138\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\">Stor (k=1,5)</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"formlik-badge\">△ABC ~ △DEF</span>\n\n      <div class=\"warn-box mt-5\">\n        <strong>Husk:</strong> Kongruens er et spesialtilfelle av formlikhet der <span class=\"highlight\">k = 1</span>.\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mt-6 mb-2\">Slik finner du manglende side</h2>\n      <div class=\"step-box\">1. Identifiser tilsvarende sider i de to figurene.</div>\n      <div class=\"step-box\">2. Regn ut skaleringsfaktoren: <strong>k = (kjent side i stor figur) ÷ (tilsvarende side i liten figur)</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"step-box\">3. Multipliser alle sider i den lille figuren med k for å finne den store figurens sider.</div>\n      <div class=\"step-box\">4. Kontroller at alle sideforhold er like.</div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4 mt-4\">\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1\">Eksempel</div>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n          Trekant ABC har sider 3, 4 og 5 cm. Trekant DEF er formlik med ABC, og den korteste siden i DEF er 6 cm.<br/>\n          <strong>k = 6 ÷ 3 = 2</strong><br/>\n          Sider i DEF: 6, 8 og 10 cm.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── TAB: TREKANTER ── -->\n  <div id=\"tab-trekant\" class=\"tab-content hidden\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-5 mb-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">Formlike trekanter – interaktivt</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Juster skaleringsfaktoren eller sett en kjent side, og se de manglende sidene beregnet steg for steg.</p>\n\n      <!-- Figurtype -->\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 mr-2\">Figurtype:</label>\n        <select id=\"triType\" onchange=\"updateTriangle()\" class=\"mr-3\">\n          <option value=\"scalene\">Skalene trekant (3 ulike sider)</option>\n          <option value=\"right\">Rettvinklet trekant</option>\n          <option value=\"isosceles\">Likebeint trekant</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Original sides -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-4\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Side a (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"triA\" value=\"3\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"0.5\" oninput=\"updateTriangle()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Side b (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"triB\" value=\"4\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"0.5\" oninput=\"updateTriangle()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Side c (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"triC\" value=\"5\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"0.5\" oninput=\"updateTriangle()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Scale factor -->\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Skaleringsfaktor k: <span id=\"kValTri\" class=\"text-blue-700\">2,0</span></label>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"kSliderTri\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"4\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"updateTriangle()\" class=\"w-full mt-1\"/>\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400\"><span>0,5 (forminsker)</span><span>k=1 (kongruent)</span><span>4,0 (forstørrer)</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Or enter a known side of the big triangle -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-3 mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1 text-sm\">Eller: oppgi én kjent side i den store trekanten for å beregne k automatisk</div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Tilsvarer side:</label>\n          <select id=\"knownSideSelect\" class=\"text-sm\" onchange=\"updateTriangle()\">\n            <option value=\"a\">a</option>\n            <option value=\"b\">b</option>\n            <option value=\"c\">c</option>\n          </select>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Verdi (cm):</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"knownSideVal\" value=\"\" min=\"0.1\" step=\"0.5\" placeholder=\"f.eks. 9\" oninput=\"knownSideInput()\" class=\"w-24\"/>\n          <button onclick=\"clearKnownSide()\" class=\"text-xs bg-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-300 rounded px-2 py-1\">Tøm</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- SVG drawing -->\n      <div class=\"svg-container my-4\" id=\"triSvgContainer\">\n        <!-- will be filled by JS -->\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Worked steps -->\n      <div id=\"triSteps\" class=\"mt-4\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── TAB: REKTANGLER ── -->\n  <div id=\"tab-rektangel\" class=\"tab-content hidden\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-5 mb-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">Formlike rektangler – interaktivt</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Sett lengde og bredde for det lille rektangelet, velg skaleringsfaktor, og se beregningene.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Lengde l (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"rectL\" value=\"6\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"0.5\" oninput=\"updateRect()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Bredde b (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"rectB\" value=\"4\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"0.5\" oninput=\"updateRect()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Skaleringsfaktor k: <span id=\"kValRect\" class=\"text-blue-700\">1,5</span></label>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"kSliderRect\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"4\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.5\" oninput=\"updateRect()\" class=\"w-full mt-1\"/>\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400\"><span>0,5</span><span>k=1 (kongruent)</span><span>4,0</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-3 mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1 text-sm\">Eller: oppgi én kjent side i det store rektangelet</div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Side:</label>\n          <select id=\"rectKnownSide\" class=\"text-sm\" onchange=\"updateRect()\">\n            <option value=\"l\">Lengde</option>\n            <option value=\"b\">Bredde</option>\n          </select>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Verdi (cm):</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"rectKnownVal\" value=\"\" min=\"0.1\" step=\"0.5\" placeholder=\"f.eks. 12\" oninput=\"rectKnownInput()\" class=\"w-24\"/>\n          <button onclick=\"clearRectKnown()\" class=\"text-xs bg-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-300 rounded px-2 py-1\">Tøm</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"svg-container my-4\" id=\"rectSvgContainer\"></div>\n      <div id=\"rectSteps\" class=\"mt-4\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── TAB: AREAL & VOLUM ── -->\n  <div id=\"tab-areal\" class=\"tab-content hidden\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-5 mb-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2\">Areal og volum skalerer</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">Når en figur skaleres med faktoren k:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-4 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n        <div class=\"formula-box text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-blue-800\">Lengde</div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl mt-1\">× k</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">lineært</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"formula-box text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-orange-700\">Areal</div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl mt-1\">× k²</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">kvadratisk</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"formula-box text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-purple-700\">Volum</div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl mt-1\">× k³</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">kubisk</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Why section -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4 mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"font-bold text-blue-800 mb-1\">Hvorfor skalerer areal med k²?</div>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">\n          Et rektangel med lengde l og bredde b har areal A = l · b.<br/>\n          Skalerer vi med k, blir lengden k·l og bredden k·b.<br/>\n          Nytt areal = (k·l) · (k·b) = <strong>k² · l · b = k² · A</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"font-bold text-purple-800 mb-1\">Hvorfor skalerer volum med k³?</div>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n          En boks med l, b, h har volum V = l·b·h.<br/>\n          Skalert: (k·l)·(k·b)·(k·h) = <strong>k³ · V</strong>.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Interactive scaler -->\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\">Velg skaleringsfaktor k: <span id=\"kValAreal\" class=\"text-blue-700\">2,0</span></label>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"kSliderAreal\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"updateAreal()\" class=\"w-full mt-1\"/>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Base shape for areal tab -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Grunnform: Lengde (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"arealL\" value=\"4\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" oninput=\"updateAreal()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold\">Grunnform: Bredde (cm)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"arealB\" value=\"3\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" oninput=\"updateAreal()\" class=\"block mt-1\"/>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"arealResult\" class=\"mb-4\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Visual comparison of squares -->\n      <div class=\"mt-4\">\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2\">Visuell sammenligning (areal):</div>\n        <div id=\"arealSvg\" class=\"flex items-end gap-8 justify-center\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Volume worked example -->\n      <div class=\"mt-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-700 mb-2\">Volumeksempel – terning</h3>\n        <div id=\"volumeExample\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Worked through example problem -->\n      <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-300 rounded-xl p-4 mt-6\">\n        <div class=\"font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-2\">Oppgaveeksempel med utregning</div>\n        <div id=\"arealExampleProblem\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div><!-- end max-w -->\n\n<script>\n// ─── Utility ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction fmt(n) {\n  return Number(n.toFixed(2)).toLocaleString('nb-NO');\n}\n\n// ─── Tab switching ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction showTab(name) {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(el => el.classList.add('hidden'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('active'));\n  document.getElementById('tab-' + name).classList.remove('hidden');\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {\n    if (btn.getAttribute('onclick') === \"showTab('\" + name + \"')\") btn.classList.add('active');\n  });\n\n  if (name === 'trekant') updateTriangle();\n  if (name === 'rektangel') updateRect();\n  if (name === 'areal') updateAreal();\n}\n\n// ─── TRIANGLE TAB ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction updateTriangle() {\n  const a = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triA').value) || 3;\n  const b = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triB').value) || 4;\n  const c = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triC').value) || 5;\n  let k = parseFloat(document.getElementById('kSliderTri').value) || 2;\n\n  document.getElementById('kValTri').textContent = fmt(k);\n\n  const a2 = a * k, b2 = b * k, c2 = c * k;\n  const isKong = Math.abs(k - 1) < 0.01;\n\n  // Build SVG for two triangles\n  const container = document.getElementById('triSvgContainer');\n  container.innerHTML = makeTwoTriangleSVGs(a, b, c, a2, b2, c2, k);\n\n  // Worked steps\n  const stepsDiv = document.getElementById('triSteps');\n  stepsDiv.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2\">Utregning – steg for steg</div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 1:</strong> Vi kjenner trekant ABC med sider\n      a = ${fmt(a)} cm, b = ${fmt(b)} cm, c = ${fmt(c)} cm.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 2:</strong> Skaleringsfaktoren er k = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k)}</span>.\n      ${isKong ? '<span class=\"kongruent-badge ml-2\">Kongruente (k=1)</span>' : '<span class=\"formlik-badge ml-2\">Formlike</span>'}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 3:</strong> Beregn alle sider i trekant DEF:\n      <ul class=\"list-disc ml-5 mt-1 text-sm\">\n        <li>d = k · a = ${fmt(k)} · ${fmt(a)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(a2)} cm</span></li>\n        <li>e = k · b = ${fmt(k)} · ${fmt(b)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(b2)} cm</span></li>\n        <li>f = k · c = ${fmt(k)} · ${fmt(c)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(c2)} cm</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Kontroll:</strong> d/a = ${fmt(a2)}/${fmt(a)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(a2/a)}</span> &nbsp;\n      e/b = ${fmt(b2)}/${fmt(b)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(b2/b)}</span> &nbsp;\n      f/c = ${fmt(c2)}/${fmt(c)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(c2/c)}</span> &nbsp;\n      ✓ Alle lik k\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formula-box mt-2\">\n      Areal av ABC = ${fmt(triangleArea(a,b,c))} cm² &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n      Areal av DEF = ${fmt(triangleArea(a2,b2,c2))} cm² &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n      Forholdstall: k² = ${fmt(k*k)}\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nfunction triangleArea(a, b, c) {\n  // Heron's formula\n  const s = (a + b + c) / 2;\n  const area2 = s * (s-a) * (s-b) * (s-c);\n  if (area2 <= 0) return 0;\n  return Math.sqrt(area2);\n}\n\nfunction triCoords(a, b, c, scale) {\n  // Place triangle with base c along x-axis, use cosine rule to find angles\n  // A at origin, B at (c*scale, 0), find C\n  const sc = scale;\n  const ax = 0, ay = 0;\n  const bx = c * sc, by = 0;\n  // cos A = (a² - b² - c²)/(-2bc) ... actually: cosA = (b²+c²-a²)/(2bc)\n  // But here a,b,c are labelled as opposite sides — let's keep it simple:\n  // Place C by computing angle at A\n  // Law of cosines: cos(A) = (b²+c²-a²)/(2bc) — a=BC, b=AC, c=AB\n  // Rename to avoid confusion: sides p=a,q=b,r=c; angle at vertex 0=A\n  const p = a * sc, q = b * sc, r = c * sc;\n  const cosA = (q*q + r*r - p*p) / (2*q*r);\n  const sinA = Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, 1 - cosA*cosA));\n  const cx = q * cosA;\n  const cy = -q * sinA; // negative because SVG y goes down\n  return { ax, ay, bx: r, by: 0, cx, cy };\n}\n\nfunction makeTwoTriangleSVGs(a, b, c, a2, b2, c2, k) {\n  const PAD = 22;\n  const SC1 = 26, SC2 = 26;\n\n  function svgForTri(sa, sb, sc, sc_factor, label1, label2, label3, titleLabel, fillColor, strokeColor) {\n    const scale = sc_factor;\n    const coords = triCoords(sa, sb, sc, scale);\n    const xs = [coords.ax, coords.bx, coords.cx];\n    const ys = [coords.ay, coords.by, coords.cy];\n    const minX = Math.min(...xs), maxX = Math.max(...xs);\n    const minY = Math.min(...ys), maxY = Math.max(...ys);\n    const W = maxX - minX + PAD*2;\n    const H = maxY - minY + PAD*2 + 24;\n    const ox = -minX + PAD, oy = -minY + PAD;\n    const pts = `${coords.ax+ox},${coords.ay+oy} ${coords.bx+ox},${coords.by+oy} ${coords.cx+ox},${coords.cy+oy}`;\n    // midpoints of sides for labels\n    const mAB = { x: (coords.ax+coords.bx)/2+ox, y: (coords.ay+coords.by)/2+oy+10 };\n    const mBC = { x: (coords.bx+coords.cx)/2+ox+8, y: (coords.by+coords.cy)/2+oy };\n    const mAC = { x: (coords.ax+coords.cx)/2+ox-14, y: (coords.ay+coords.cy)/2+oy };\n    return `<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n      <svg width=\"${Math.round(W)}\" height=\"${Math.round(H)}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${Math.round(W)} ${Math.round(H)}\" aria-label=\"${titleLabel}\">\n        <polygon points=\"${pts}\" fill=\"${fillColor}\" stroke=\"${strokeColor}\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <text x=\"${coords.ax+ox-8}\" y=\"${coords.ay+oy}\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text>\n        <text x=\"${coords.bx+ox+4}\" y=\"${coords.by+oy}\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text>\n        <text x=\"${coords.cx+ox-6}\" y=\"${coords.cy+oy-4}\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text>\n        <text x=\"${mAB.x}\" y=\"${mAB.y}\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#b45309\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${label1} cm</text>\n        <text x=\"${mBC.x}\" y=\"${mBC.y}\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#b45309\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${label2} cm</text>\n        <text x=\"${mAC.x}\" y=\"${mAC.y}\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#b45309\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${label3} cm</text>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 mt-1\">${titleLabel}</div>\n    </div>`;\n  }\n\n  const s1 = svgForTri(a, b, c, SC1, fmt(c), fmt(a), fmt(b), 'Trekant ABC', '#dbeafe', '#3b82f6');\n  const arrow = `<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center pb-8\">\n    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg\">×k=${fmt(k)}</span>\n    <span class=\"text-3xl text-blue-500\">→</span>\n  </div>`;\n  const s2 = svgForTri(a2, b2, c2, SC1, fmt(c2), fmt(a2), fmt(b2), 'Trekant DEF', '#bfdbfe', '#2563eb');\n\n  return `<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center\">${s1}${arrow}${s2}</div>`;\n}\n\nfunction knownSideInput() {\n  const val = parseFloat(document.getElementById('knownSideVal').value);\n  if (!val || val <= 0) { updateTriangle(); return; }\n  const side = document.getElementById('knownSideSelect').value;\n  let orig;\n  if (side === 'a') orig = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triA').value);\n  else if (side === 'b') orig = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triB').value);\n  else orig = parseFloat(document.getElementById('triC').value);\n  if (!orig || orig <= 0) return;\n  const k = val / orig;\n  const slider = document.getElementById('kSliderTri');\n  const clampedK = Math.min(4, Math.max(0.5, k));\n  slider.value = clampedK;\n  document.getElementById('kValTri').textContent = fmt(clampedK);\n  updateTriangle();\n}\n\nfunction clearKnownSide() {\n  document.getElementById('knownSideVal').value = '';\n  updateTriangle();\n}\n\n// ─── RECTANGLE TAB ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction updateRect() {\n  const l = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rectL').value) || 6;\n  const b = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rectB').value) || 4;\n  let k = parseFloat(document.getElementById('kSliderRect').value) || 1.5;\n\n  document.getElementById('kValRect').textContent = fmt(k);\n  const l2 = l * k, b2 = b * k;\n  const isKong = Math.abs(k - 1) < 0.01;\n\n  const container = document.getElementById('rectSvgContainer');\n  container.innerHTML = makeTwoRectSVGs(l, b, l2, b2, k);\n\n  const stepsDiv = document.getElementById('rectSteps');\n  stepsDiv.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2\">Utregning – steg for steg</div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 1:</strong> Rektangel ABCD: lengde = ${fmt(l)} cm, bredde = ${fmt(b)} cm.\n      Areal₁ = ${fmt(l)} × ${fmt(b)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(l*b)} cm²</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 2:</strong> Skaleringsfaktor k = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k)}</span>.\n      ${isKong ? '<span class=\"kongruent-badge ml-2\">Kongruente (k=1)</span>' : '<span class=\"formlik-badge ml-2\">Formlike</span>'}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 3:</strong> Rektangel EFGH:\n      <ul class=\"list-disc ml-5 mt-1 text-sm\">\n        <li>Lengde = k · l = ${fmt(k)} · ${fmt(l)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(l2)} cm</span></li>\n        <li>Bredde = k · b = ${fmt(k)} · ${fmt(b)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(b2)} cm</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Steg 4:</strong> Areal av EFGH = ${fmt(l2)} × ${fmt(b2)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(l2*b2)} cm²</span>\n      = k² · Areal₁ = ${fmt(k*k)} · ${fmt(l*b)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k*k*l*b)} cm²</span> ✓\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Kontroll sideforhold:</strong> l'/l = ${fmt(l2)}/${fmt(l)} = ${fmt(l2/l)} &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n      b'/b = ${fmt(b2)}/${fmt(b)} = ${fmt(b2/b)} &nbsp; ✓ begge lik k\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nfunction makeTwoRectSVGs(l, b, l2, b2, k) {\n  const MAX_W = 130;\n  function rectSVG(lv, bv, fillColor, strokeColor, titleLabel) {\n    const scale = Math.min(MAX_W / Math.max(lv, bv), 14);\n    const sw = lv * scale, sh = bv * scale;\n    const W = sw + 40, H = sh + 44;\n    return `<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n      <svg width=\"${Math.round(W)}\" height=\"${Math.round(H)}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${Math.round(W)} ${Math.round(H)}\" aria-label=\"${titleLabel}\">\n        <rect x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"${sw}\" height=\"${sh}\" fill=\"${fillColor}\" stroke=\"${strokeColor}\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <text x=\"${20+sw/2}\" y=\"${14+sh+16}\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b45309\">${fmt(lv)} cm</text>\n        <text x=\"8\" y=\"${14+sh/2}\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b45309\" transform=\"rotate(-90,8,${14+sh/2})\">${fmt(bv)} cm</text>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 mt-1\">${titleLabel}</div>\n    </div>`;\n  }\n  const r1 = rectSVG(l, b, '#dbeafe', '#3b82f6', 'Rektangel ABCD');\n  const arrow = `<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center pb-8\">\n    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg\">×k=${fmt(k)}</span>\n    <span class=\"text-3xl text-blue-500\">→</span>\n  </div>`;\n  const r2 = rectSVG(l2, b2, '#bfdbfe', '#2563eb', 'Rektangel EFGH');\n  return `<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center\">${r1}${arrow}${r2}</div>`;\n}\n\nfunction rectKnownInput() {\n  const val = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rectKnownVal').value);\n  if (!val || val <= 0) { updateRect(); return; }\n  const side = document.getElementById('rectKnownSide').value;\n  let orig;\n  if (side === 'l') orig = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rectL').value);\n  else orig = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rectB').value);\n  if (!orig || orig <= 0) return;\n  const k = val / orig;\n  const slider = document.getElementById('kSliderRect');\n  const clampedK = Math.min(4, Math.max(0.5, k));\n  slider.value = clampedK;\n  document.getElementById('kValRect').textContent = fmt(clampedK);\n  updateRect();\n}\n\nfunction clearRectKnown() {\n  document.getElementById('rectKnownVal').value = '';\n  updateRect();\n}\n\n// ─── AREAL & VOLUM TAB ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction updateAreal() {\n  const k = parseFloat(document.getElementById('kSliderAreal').value) || 2;\n  const l = parseFloat(document.getElementById('arealL').value) || 4;\n  const b = parseFloat(document.getElementById('arealB').value) || 3;\n  document.getElementById('kValAreal').textContent = fmt(k);\n\n  const l2 = l * k, b2 = b * k;\n  const A1 = l * b, A2 = l2 * b2;\n  const k2 = k * k, k3 = k * k * k;\n\n  // Result boxes\n  document.getElementById('arealResult').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-2\">\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-blue-700 font-bold\">Grunnform</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm\">l = ${fmt(l)} cm, b = ${fmt(b)} cm</div>\n        <div class=\"font-bold mt-1\">Areal = ${fmt(A1)} cm²</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center border-2 border-orange-300\">\n        <div class=\"text-orange-700 font-bold\">Skalert form (k=${fmt(k)})</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm\">l' = ${fmt(l2)} cm, b' = ${fmt(b2)} cm</div>\n        <div class=\"font-bold mt-1\">Areal = ${fmt(A2)} cm²</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-green-700 font-bold\">Arealforhold</div>\n        <div class=\"text-2xl mt-1 font-bold text-green-800\">k² = ${fmt(k2)}</div>\n        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">${fmt(A2)}/${fmt(A1)} = ${fmt(A2/A1)}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box mt-3\">\n      <strong>Utregning:</strong><br/>\n      Areal₁ = ${fmt(l)} × ${fmt(b)} = ${fmt(A1)} cm²<br/>\n      Areal₂ = (k·l) × (k·b) = (${fmt(k)}·${fmt(l)}) × (${fmt(k)}·${fmt(b)}) = ${fmt(l2)} × ${fmt(b2)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(A2)} cm²</span><br/>\n      Areal₂ / Areal₁ = ${fmt(A2)} / ${fmt(A1)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(A2/A1)}</span> = k² = ${fmt(k)}² = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k2)}</span> ✓\n    </div>\n  `;\n\n  // Visual SVG area comparison\n  const maxSide = 120;\n  const s1 = Math.min(maxSide, Math.sqrt(A1) * 18);\n  const s2 = Math.min(maxSide, s1 * k);\n  document.getElementById('arealSvg').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n      <svg width=\"${Math.round(s1+4)}\" height=\"${Math.round(s1+4)}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${Math.round(s1+4)} ${Math.round(s1+4)}\" aria-label=\"Grunnform areal\">\n        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"${Math.round(s1)}\" height=\"${Math.round(s1)}\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"text-xs text-blue-700 mt-1 font-semibold\">A = ${fmt(A1)} cm²</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center pb-6 text-blue-500 font-bold text-lg\">×k²=${fmt(k2)}</div>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n      <svg width=\"${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120)+4)}\" height=\"${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120)+4)}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120)+4)} ${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120)+4)}\" aria-label=\"Skalert areal\">\n        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120))}\" height=\"${Math.round(Math.min(s2,120))}\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"text-xs text-orange-700 mt-1 font-semibold\">A' = ${fmt(A2)} cm²${s2 > 120 ? ' (beskåret)' : ''}</div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n\n  // Volume example – cube with side l\n  const V1 = l * l * l;\n  const V2 = l2 * l2 * l2;\n  document.getElementById('volumeExample').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Terning med side ${fmt(l)} cm:</strong><br/>\n      Volum = ${fmt(l)}³ = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(V1)} cm³</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Skalert terning (k=${fmt(k)}), side = k·${fmt(l)} = ${fmt(l2)} cm:</strong><br/>\n      Volum = ${fmt(l2)}³ = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(V2)} cm³</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <strong>Volumforhold:</strong> ${fmt(V2)} / ${fmt(V1)} = ${fmt(V2/V1)} = k³ = ${fmt(k)}³ = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k3)}</span> ✓\n    </div>\n  `;\n\n  // Worked example problem\n  document.getElementById('arealExampleProblem').innerHTML = `\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">\n      <strong>Oppgave:</strong> Et fotografi er 10 cm × 15 cm. Det skal forstørres med k = ${fmt(k)}.<br/>\n      Hva er det nye arealet, og hva er forholdstallet mellom arealene?\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"step-box text-sm\">\n      <strong>Steg 1:</strong> Opprinnelig areal = 10 × 15 = <span class=\"highlight\">150 cm²</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box text-sm\">\n      <strong>Steg 2:</strong> Nytt areal = k² × 150 = ${fmt(k2)} × 150 = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k2 * 150)} cm²</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box text-sm\">\n      <strong>Steg 3:</strong> Nye mål: ${fmt(10*k)} cm × ${fmt(15*k)} cm.\n      Areal = ${fmt(10*k)} × ${fmt(15*k)} = <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(10*k*15*k)} cm²</span> ✓\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-box text-sm\">\n      <strong>Svar:</strong> Nytt areal er <span class=\"highlight\">${fmt(k2 * 150)} cm²</span>, som er k² = ${fmt(k2)} ganger det opprinnelige.\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ─── Init ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nupdateTriangle();\nupdateRect();\nupdateAreal();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "packaging": {
    "appName": "Formlikhet og kongruens",
    "windowTitle": "Formlikhet og kongruens",
    "bundleId": "com.halisonworks.geoformlikhet",
    "iconPath": null
  },
  "categoryId": null,
  "source": "import",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-02T12:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-06-02T12:00:00.000Z",
  "sharedAt": "2026-06-02T12:00:00.000Z"
}
